sequenceDiagram
    participant Page as Live page
    participant Server as Local server
    participant Liquid as Liquid d1-ultra
    participant Claude as Claude narrator
    loop every sample interval, default 500 ms
        Page->>Page: grab frame, compare 64x40 grayscale with last stable frame
    end
    Page->>Page: change detected, wait until the frame settles
    Page->>Server: POST /api/decide with before and after JPEG
    Server->>Liquid: core questions announce, kind, urgency, sensitive
    Liquid-->>Server: probabilities
    Server->>Server: toPrediction then decide with the thresholds
    Server-->>Page: prediction, decision, latency, cost
    Page->>Page: speak, queue, keep for What's new, or stay silent
    opt narration on and decision is narratable
        Page->>Server: POST /api/narrate with the after frame
        Server->>Claude: describe the main change in one sentence
        Claude-->>Server: narration
        Server->>Liquid: is every claim supported by the screen
        Liquid-->>Server: P supported
        Server-->>Page: narration, speak flag, cost
        Page->>Page: speak the detail only if the speak flag is set
    end
